726        options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
726      ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
727        %let syscc=0;
728        title; footnote;
729        ods _all_ close;
730        ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
731        ods graphics off;
732        proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
